Cairn v0.0.20

• History now records all day, not just while the app is open.
• Trips coloured by walk, cycle or vehicle, with arrows and numbered stops.
• Gaps in your data show as gaps, not long journeys.
• Days run midnight to midnight, your time.
• Scrub by time; tap a trip to focus it.
• Optional: snap a trip to roads.
• Fixed the History map sometimes staying blank.
• Choose whether contacts see your speed and direction.
• See-through pins on the map.

All end-to-end encrypted.
